Z||000017||pHoOl||05-30-2001||01:30 AM||||Well, actually, i wasn't talking about running out and spraypainting my name spelled right or wrong anywhere.  i just think that it looks cool (must be the growing up in metro detroit thing).  anyway... i've just been messing with it on the computer and was curious if anyone is into doing it too.  not like i'm trying to claim any gang on the forum.  (should we start a PFF gang?  j/k)  <P>Unfortunately i have no artistic skills whatsoever, so i guess that would count me out.  Thanks for all the creative posts though.<P>------------------<BR>Fuzz busters are for those who can't outrun the cops.<P>AIM: phool88fiero<P>    <IMG SRC="http://www.gvsuphool.homestead.com/files/pHoOl_sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
